    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277888</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_050_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>クルール！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Couleuru!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277968</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_050_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うぉおっと……！
な、何だ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whooaaa...!
Wh-What the?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278056</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_050_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>この子、さっき魔物に
襲われてた子？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, isn't this the little one
that was being attacked
by monsters, earlier?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278136</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_050_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>クルール！　クルール！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Couleuru! Couleuru!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278200</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_050_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どうしたの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's wrong?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278268</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_050_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>クルール！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Couleuru!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278368</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_050_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>なんか……
ついてきたがってる
みたいだけド……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It kind of seems
like... It wants to
come with us, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278472</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_050_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ダメダメ。
おまえみたいなチビっ子、
連れてけねって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nah, no way. We're not
bringing some little
thing like you with us.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278544</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_050_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>クルール！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Couleuru!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278656</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_050_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ゴメンね、わたしたち、
これから危険なところへ
行くから……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm really sorry, but we're
going somewhere
dangerous right now, so...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278728</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_050_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……危険なのかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...It will be
dangerous,
won't it?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278824</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_050_012&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>全然だいじょーぶだって。
なんとかなるって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nah, it'll be perfectly fine.
We'll figure it out somehow.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278944</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_050_013&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mel&gt;は先に家に帰って。
心配ないよ、
&lt;Dio&gt;にはぼくがついてくかラ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You can go back home
first, &lt;Mel&gt;. Don't worry,
I'll go with &lt;Dio&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279076</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_050_014&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……ううん、行くよ。
だって、あの魔術はわたしが
したことなのかもしれないし……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...No, I'll come. I mean,
that magic might
be my fault, so...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279320</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_050_017&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そうしないとダメだと
思うから</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I feel like it'd
be really bad
if I didn't.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279384</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_050_018&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そう……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You're sure...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279440</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_050_019&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
